  "description": "Run the canvas-word headless layout / import / export pipeline from C# — DOCX import, page-accurate PDF export, DOCX export, a fluent DocumentBuilder, and headless TOC/field recalculation — with no browser, Node process, or engine port. The exact JavaScript the editor and Node backend run is hosted inside a V8 isolate via ClearScript. A fast, low-allocation alternative to Syncfusion DocIO for DOCX-to-PDF. Windows x64.",
